{
  "total_ms": 68860,
  "total_chars": 296,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "老张站在人家门口，手都是抖的。",
      "chars": 15,
      "speech_ms": 2830,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2830,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "满楼就老李会修水管，偏偏这位老李，半年前让老张得罪透了。",
      "chars": 28,
      "speech_ms": 5300,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 3230,
      "end_ms": 8530,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "就说楼下的老张吧：为个停车位，跟老李吵翻了，话说得绝，老死不相往来。",
      "chars": 34,
      "speech_ms": 7550,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 8930,
      "end_ms": 16480,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "《名言佳句》这本书里，收了一句俄罗斯老话，归在克雷洛夫名下：不要把痰吐在井里，哪天你口渴的时候，也要上井边来喝水。",
      "chars": 57,
      "speech_ms": 12920,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 16880,
      "end_ms": 29800,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这话提醒的就是——别只顾一时痛快。",
      "chars": 17,
      "speech_ms": 3620,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 30200,
      "end_ms": 33820,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这不，半年后老张家水管爆了，水漫到楼下。",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 4970,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 34220,
      "end_ms": 39190,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您说这门，敲还是不敲？",
      "chars": 11,
      "speech_ms": 2160,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 39590,
      "end_ms": 41750,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "敲吧，话说绝了，没那个脸；不敲吧，家里还淌着水呢。",
      "chars": 25,
      "speech_ms": 6580,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 42150,
      "end_ms": 48730,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "说到底，留三分路不是什么大道理，就是给日子留个回旋：今天您给人留的门，明天可能就是自己的路。",
      "chars": 46,
      "speech_ms": 9790,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 49130,
      "end_ms": 58920,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "书就在我主页橱窗里，点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
      "chars": 24,
      "speech_ms": 4770,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 59320,
      "end_ms": 64090,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A11",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "把人得罪光了又回头求人的事，您见过吗？",
      "chars": 19,
      "speech_ms": 3970,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 64490,
      "end_ms": 68460,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}